        {
          "id": "428c4d79-a74e-34df-974e-a29f1a950e9b",
          "content": {
            "id": "428c4d79-a74e-34df-974e-a29f1a950e9b",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Fed's rate decision, Oracle & Broadcom earnings: What to Watch",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination Overtime host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> takes a look at the top stories for investors to watch next week, starting Monday, Dec. 8.</p>\n<p>Another wave of earnings is on tap: Toll Brothers (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TOL\">TOL</a>) on Monday, Campbell's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CPB\">CPB</a>) and Cracker Barrel (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CBRL\">CBRL</a>) on Tuesday, Oracle (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) and Adobe (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ADBE\">ADBE</a>) on Wednesday, Broadcom (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AVGO\">AVGO</a>) and Costco (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/COST\">COST</a>) on Thursday, and Rent the Runway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RENT\">RENT</a>) on Friday, among others.</p>\n<p>The Small Business Association's (SBA's) National Federation of Independent Business (NFIB) will release its monthly Small Business Optimism Index.</p>\n<p>The Federal Reserve's December meeting will kick off on Tuesday, while the FOMC's decision on interest rates will be announced on Wednesday.</p>\n<p>Tune in to <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/?fr=sycsrp_catchall\">Yahoo Finance</a> on Wednesday, Dec. 10 at 2:00 p.m. for live coverage of Fed Chair Jerome Powell's post-decision press conference.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Market Domination Overtime host Josh Lipton takes a look at the top stories for investors to watch next week, starting Monday, Dec. 8. Another wave of earnings is on tap: Toll Brothers (TOL) on Monday, Campbell's (CPB) and Cracker Barrel (CBRL) on Tuesday, Oracle (ORCL) and Adobe (ADBE) on Wednesday, Broadcom (AVGO) and Costco (COST) on Thursday, and Rent the Runway (RENT) on Friday, among others. The Small Business Association's (SBA's) National Federation of Independent Business (NFIB) will release its monthly Small Business Optimism Index. The Federal Reserve's December meeting will kick off on Tuesday, while the FOMC's decision on interest rates will be announced on Wednesday. Tune in to Yahoo Finance on Wednesday, Dec. 10 at 2:00 p.m. for live coverage of Fed Chair Jerome Powell's post-decision press conference. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination Overtime.",
